## 📋 Cara Menjalankan

```bash
npm install
npm run generate:keys
npm run migrate
npm run prod

## Environment Variables yang Wajib Diisi

- `DB_HOST`, `DB_PASSWORD`
- `REDIS_HOST`
- `JWT_SECRET`, `SESSION_SECRET`
- `TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY` (32 chars)
- `DANA_CLIENT_ID`, `DANA_CLIENT_SECRET` (setelah onboarding)
- `SHOPEEPAY_MERCHANT_ID`, `SHOPEEPAY_SECRET_KEY`
- `QRIS_PROVIDER` (interactive/doku/midtrans)
- API Key dari provider yang dipilih
- `QRIS_WEBHOOK_SECRET` (32 chars)
```

---

## 📊 Ringkasan API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Fungsi |
|--------|----------|--------|
| POST | `/api/qris/generate` | Generate QRIS payment |
| GET | `/api/qris/status/:orderId` | Check payment status |
| GET | `/api/qris/image/:orderId` | Get QR code image |
| POST | `/api/qris/webhook` | Webhook notification |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/register` | Register user |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/login` | Login user |
| GET | `/api/v1/dana/connect` | Initiate DANA OAuth |
| GET | `/api/v1/dana/callback` | DANA OAuth callback |
| GET | `/api/v1/dana/profile` | Get DANA nickname |
| DELETE | `/api/v1/dana/disconnect` | Disconnect DANA |
| POST | `/api/v1/shopeepay/connect` | Initiate ShopeePay OAuth |
| GET | `/api/v1/shopeepay/callback` | ShopeePay callback |
| GET | `/api/v1/shopeepay/profile` | Get ShopeePay nickname |
| DELETE | `/api/v1/shopeepay/disconnect` | Disconnect ShopeePay |